   "worked_solution": [
      {
         "step": 1,
         "text": "The composite has outer function F with \\( \\frac{d}{du} u^{2} = 2 u \\) and inner function \\( u = 30 - 3 x^{2} \\), whose derivative is \\( - 6 x \\).",
         "point_type_id": "BC-PT-99023",
         "rule_named": "identify the layers"
      },
      {
         "step": 2,
         "text": "By the product rule and the chain rule, \\( h'(x) = - 36 x^{3} \\left(30 - 3 x^{2}\\right) + 6 x \\left(30 - 3 x^{2}\\right)^{2} \\).",
         "point_type_id": "BC-PT-99023",
         "rule_named": "product rule with the chain rule"
      },
      {
         "step": 3,
         "text": "At x = -3 the inner value is 3 and the inner derivative is 18, so \\( h'(-3) = -162 + 27 \\cdot 6 \\cdot 18 = 2754 \\).",
